###  Prune stale window thumbnails.  Thumbnails expire after 100s and are
###  recaptured on demand, so anything a week old belongs to a window that is
###  long gone.  Without this the cache only grows -- it had reached 9641
###  files / 239MB before the sweep was added.  Runs on restart too; it is a
###  find over a few hundred files.
+ I Exec exec find $[FVWM_USERDIR]/images/thumbs -maxdepth 1 -type f -mtime +7 -delete
+ I Schedule 100 Module Thumbnail
+ I Schedule Periodic 300000 1222 5minutes
+ I Test (EnvMatch DISPLAY :1) Read vnc-overrides

